  "authority_notes": "Feature-OFF backup composition plus Linear, generic Source, Buzz and Hermes backup-generation contracts and a public-safe synthetic recovery canary. The canary creates deterministic temp-only bytes, a create-only backup, full hash readback and isolated restore receipt; only a separate out-of-band Human Owner pin with a distinct backup operator can accept that exact technical receipt. It cannot claim NAS, RPO/RTO, recovery-ready or Internal RC. Linear whole-workspace generations retain their deterministic project index, and Buzz/Hermes retain separate custody and acceptance boundaries. These public contracts do not grant source, task, artifact, Agent or completion authority. Actual binding, provider bytes, service quiescence, recurring execution and human acceptance remain separate private gates."
